msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Y'know, nothing beats the down-tempo atmosphere of this place! Millennium "
"Tower was well-equipped and all, but what with everything that's happened "
"there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "(Kashiwagi-san...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I guess the only complaint I have about this place is that there aren't any "
"convenience stores nearby."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"There used to be some soup kitchens nearby, but not anymore. Of course, we "
"do go out drinking with Majima's men every now and then, so it's really not "
"so bad."
msgstr ""

